#: scenario6:scenario6_556C1399_D7A0_4B38_A6DB_6946491A8160
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dad0a1188f4b6f3247ab624cf30685db6afe1c6206cef0d5f5d03a0d07c95491
#. default-sha256: 1f743753d52207606f25d059a713d70ad1cb6e0c42755041b3cb85fde8de698d
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_556C1399_D7A0_4B38_A6DB_6946491A8160"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫I apologize for making you listen to my dreadful stories for so long. "
"⟪k:38⟫You must be quite weary of them by now."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫Je suis désolée de prendre autant de temps pour vous raconter mon "
"horrible histoire. ⟪k:38⟫La lassitude doit vous guetter, à ce stade."

#: scenario6:scenario6_22E7D063_B796_4594_A606_5DBD3B193E2D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 168cb66c1f4a10066a8381fa572b0a484f38feff3e987cae5395b834b78b2c24
#. default-sha256: 9305be02af2d06780bdc271b6da94e512970d531bf082c1493c4a576e5d7cbc8
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_22E7D063_B796_4594_A606_5DBD3B193E2D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But worry not, for this is the final one."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mais ne vous inquiétez pas car c’est le dernier conte."

#: scenario6:scenario6_5FFD9067_E11D_4279_AA9B_4F0DC72D8A27
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4d404ce76e1b7e0c7fc3b08b9d96dd90b8632f9f1a46a84c98f0ec98e43a479d
#. default-sha256: 2e82361969bcbf9c528904265f61a0e1c0dfe5ec736a8e6ef9f25c358efed368
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_5FFD9067_E11D_4279_AA9B_4F0DC72D8A27"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And despite being the end, it is neither dramatic nor exciting."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Et cela a beau être la fin, ce n’est ni trépidant ni excitant."

#: scenario6:scenario6_72F9EB16_EAA9_4710_9482_6C51B1F9FC15
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 47aa5df7f4f7bd15fdbc2c24f7ec2ee94d5caf8570fd47b8b8f86dd043a01493
#. default-sha256: 59c70895070484c3a04ea78efe2b5bef92e7e2683ecf50cba1b3a49019e072fd
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_72F9EB16_EAA9_4710_9482_6C51B1F9FC15"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was a single phrase—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫the most insignificant of things—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫C’est une simple phrase —⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ la plus insignifiante des choses —"

#: scenario6:scenario6_076A4C37_956A_4FC0_B6F2_2CEC0EEF1EB9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: db7f3304a01fed2e18ebabbfaef44ea0d59dd5312b53c2cd3b1949f0196f18b6
#. default-sha256: 4cad279b447ac5da19986475718b550eeaecd03750305ac86b6874d8e91f9a73
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_076A4C37_956A_4FC0_B6F2_2CEC0EEF1EB9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫that caused me to completely lose myself and forget I had, long ago, been the woman called "
"Giselle."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫qui me poussa à me perdre complètement et à oublier qu’il y a fort longtemps j’avais été une "
"femme qui s’appelait Giselle."

#: scenario6:scenario6_FF896C7C_8BFE_4088_A051_EDE1EE66FF96
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4e569b069367c1f40c0220440375566c8f98dba62fdb31e3bbc0d508f9eaa98d
#. default-sha256: 484e3e90f71940cda26ba8fb80aaddd39872aa682e3e476bd3ec71bd2a0eabba
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_FF896C7C_8BFE_4088_A051_EDE1EE66FF96"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫There was no malice in it. ⟪k:1⟫It was but a simple greeting."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il n’y avait aucune malice dans cette phrase. ⟪k:1⟫Ce n’était qu’une salutation ordinaire."

#: scenario6:scenario6_53347EC4_B414_492B_993D_8757F2C0E14B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c4e05a9a59cfd3a8151ac3c06d3f4992cd1cc23942fa50246b052a0dda677304
#. default-sha256: 5a708232054a43b042722b9b9f99d8dd853eef89032e50eb047ed2f4e6d57cd9
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_53347EC4_B414_492B_993D_8757F2C0E14B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Do you remember how, the first time she arrived,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Vous vous rappelez, la première fois où elle est arrivée,"

#: scenario6:scenario6_10F6EC42_4F81_46A1_BC78_36A8A802846B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 25ec669fed2dddd3ae58eae7952c61a0db1d45b411edf51df33fa9df7d0b442d
#. default-sha256: 05e70d4ebcedb91c87938c20934015907169fe08e88720b2886e2ced009c88ad
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_10F6EC42_4F81_46A1_BC78_36A8A802846B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Michel” said I had a peculiar presence about me?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫She felt something there between "
"us."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫quand « Michel » a dit que je dégageais quelque chose d’étrange ?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Elle a senti "
"quelque chose entre nous."

#: scenario6:scenario6_FEA9E9B7_5E6D_4C21_8873_F2ABE720FA54
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d55c1310d8d2a600ba8ad1c3191ade43a11f03c9c950f76eedf710faec0b0ade
#. default-sha256: 9c9378a5a0d6e4591b4fe691395731e369c067198b64341c31617892c6ef7776
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_FEA9E9B7_5E6D_4C21_8873_F2ABE720FA54"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And the second time, she said something about me seemed familiar.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫She did not "
"remember why, but her soul recognized the bonds we shared."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et la seconde fois, elle a dit qu’elle avait l’impression de me connaître.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Elle ne "
"se souvenait pas pourquoi mais son âme avait reconnu les liens que nous avions partagés."

#: scenario6:scenario6_F06992C8_18FF_4B48_8EA8_D9231880549E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 87e704ba8c5084748d1aa44833cca0a35595053acb93dbfc6ba4ffae861de4c0
#. default-sha256: 4f0bbd45c30176f9d6b487562c2f0b32a77a9234b2edc9785d6274f0308b2738
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_F06992C8_18FF_4B48_8EA8_D9231880549E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫So I assumed that the next time she showed up, she would feel something even stronger, ⟪k:1⟫"
"or perhaps even have her memories."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫J’avais donc supposé que lors de notre rencontre suivante, elle ressentirait quelque chose "
"d’encore plus fort, ⟪k:1⟫ou même qu’elle retrouverait la mémoire."

#: scenario6:scenario6_1051D477_1775_45A0_8D7B_5C6294BD13D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0e21936d4299c2c89feb1531299646a7530e4acfc3c901373c58b8340100535c
#. default-sha256: 84dc02a70c38dd72d1b4e5a541f475cfcdd192edc2fe1a9f0a1f16fe31ac77c4
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_1051D477_1775_45A0_8D7B_5C6294BD13D1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Despite having been let down again and again, I still held on to the faintest glimmer of "
"hope."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫J’avais beau avoir été déçue encore et encore, je m’accrochai toujours à ce maigre espoir."

#: scenario6:scenario6_5D0DB885_0ECC_4ECB_9B27_6A1CF4DE51C3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d038825be9388971200da03a17a824f567685067a840679c8733e4d787a1f2d2
#. default-sha256: 8db933a9c507d8eed94afb064d02e7947fe9ddf9967e4a58f2bccc27fe27b3eb
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_5D0DB885_0ECC_4ECB_9B27_6A1CF4DE51C3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But when she appeared, ⟪k:1⟫she was someone else’s wife."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mais quand elle apparut, ⟪k:1⟫elle était la femme de quelqu’un d’autre."

#: scenario6:scenario6_CCAA917E_5CB3_4728_BF9E_D35A17A92BF1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 701a3b7f83126867ad380b288451dc581483ddd9e3a9abe0c6be1fc57d7b2106
