msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...?"

#: scenario6:scenario6_16E316EF_B176_4919_8842_25639A4FFD25
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4e1c83f5196b11d8e5dd499377b308875f7d65a205120ba96d995fbd49ccf49f
