msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_16E316EF_B176_4919_8842_25639A4FFD25"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hey, get out here!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Christ, there’s not a goddamned confident bone in your "
"body, is there?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hé, venez par là !⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Bordel, vous n’avez pas une once de confiance en vous, "
"c’est pas vrai ?"

#: scenario6:scenario6_14684D65_8FA9_4010_953A_C2D2C8D024EC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5bb631338f214caf2a33f68791096b91e0e733e9a6a49c172a75b6cbf26467b2
