msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It’s a pleasure to meet you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫« Enchantée de faire votre connaissance. »"

#: scenario6:scenario6_083071E8_9111_45AE_8A4B_D0C4122FF24C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2795a9cbb37e5893f0aeeab962f7dad4d592e177fa7c94121f70c682c7234fdb
