msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫« Enchantée de faire votre connaissance. »"

#: scenario6:scenario6_666D9EDB_836D_4578_AA5F_8AD6C8F27534
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 46f2509a89a7af4e777dc67cc047318e5f3fb33379d0676a816dd422f4ae24d2
